==Description==
The '''Green Poison Nametag''' is an unreleased nametag, originally meant to release in the [[Null & Void Event]]. Currently, this can technically be used by players, as the effects used in the nametag were accidentally applied to the [[Green Nametag]].

The '''Green Poison Nametag''' has green gradient text and a slightly translucent dark green outline. Green fog and green sparks appear behind the text.

